{"seq":1,"slug":"warehouse-allocation","title":"多仓分货与履约路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/fulfillment-sync/warehouse-allocation","wordCount":2178,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多仓分货与履约路由\">多仓分货与履约路由</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>支付成功的瞬间，库存从「账面上的承诺」变成了「必须发出的实物」。此时系统要回答一个此前一直被推迟的问题：<strong>这件货从哪个仓发？</strong></p>\n<p>如果下单时预占的是「全国虚拟池」，这个问题在履约时才有答案，而答案可能是「没有单个仓能凑齐订单的全部 SKU」；如果下单时已经按仓预占，那么履约路由在下单时就完成了，履约阶段只是把预占转成出库指令。两种做法的差别体现在库存表的结构上（见 <a href=\"../inventory-model/sku-warehouse-model\">SKU 与分仓/渠道库存模型</a>），也决定了履约阶段是否会出现「有单无货」。</p>\n<p>履约路由的目标函数不是单目标，而是四个目标的加权：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>成本。</strong> 运费、包材、仓内操作成本。跨区发货的运费可能是同区的两倍以上。</li>\n<li><strong>时效。</strong> 承诺的送达时间与实际的仓到收货地距离直接相关。</li>\n<li><strong>库存健康。</strong> 优先消耗临期、滞销、高仓储成本的库存，避免它们变成损失。</li>\n<li><strong>仓产能。</strong> 仓在高峰期有出库单量上限，路由不能把全部压力集中到一个仓。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    O[&quot;订单: 3 个 SKU&lt;br/&gt;收货地 杭州&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;候选仓检索&lt;br/&gt;各 SKU 的可发货仓&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; C1[&quot;仓 A 上海&lt;br/&gt;SKU1✓ SKU2✓ SKU3✗&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; C2[&quot;仓 B 广州&lt;br/&gt;SKU1✓ SKU2✗ SKU3✓&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; C3[&quot;仓 C 杭州&lt;br/&gt;SKU1✗ SKU2✓ SKU3✓&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; EVAL[&quot;路由评估&lt;br/&gt;成本/时效/产能/库存健康&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; EVAL&#10;    C3 --&gt; EVAL&#10;    EVAL --&gt; D1[&quot;单仓发货: 无可行解&lt;br/&gt;需拆单&quot;]&#10;    EVAL --&gt; D2[&quot;拆单方案 1&lt;br/&gt;仓A(SKU1,SKU2) + 仓B(SKU3)&quot;]&#10;    EVAL --&gt; D3[&quot;拆单方案 2&lt;br/&gt;仓B(SKU1,SKU3) + 仓C(SKU2)&quot;]&#10;    D2 --&gt; PICK[&quot;选最优: 比较总成本+时效+拆单惩罚&quot;]&#10;    D3 --&gt; PICK&#10;    PICK --&gt; RES[&quot;生成发货单&lt;br/&gt;触发 WMS 出库&quot;]\">graph TD\n    O[\"订单: 3 个 SKU&lt;br/&gt;收货地 杭州\"] --&gt; S[\"候选仓检索&lt;br/&gt;各 SKU 的可发货仓\"]\n    S --&gt; C1[\"仓 A 上海&lt;br/&gt;SKU1✓ SKU2✓ SKU3✗\"]\n    S --&gt; C2[\"仓 B 广州&lt;br/&gt;SKU1✓ SKU2✗ SKU3✓\"]\n    S --&gt; C3[\"仓 C 杭州&lt;br/&gt;SKU1✗ SKU2✓ SKU3✓\"]\n    C1 --&gt; EVAL[\"路由评估&lt;br/&gt;成本/时效/产能/库存健康\"]\n    C2 --&gt; EVAL\n    C3 --&gt; EVAL\n    EVAL --&gt; D1[\"单仓发货: 无可行解&lt;br/&gt;需拆单\"]\n    EVAL --&gt; D2[\"拆单方案 1&lt;br/&gt;仓A(SKU1,SKU2) + 仓B(SKU3)\"]\n    EVAL --&gt; D3[\"拆单方案 2&lt;br/&gt;仓B(SKU1,SKU3) + 仓C(SKU2)\"]\n    D2 --&gt; PICK[\"选最优: 比较总成本+时效+拆单惩罚\"]\n    D3 --&gt; PICK\n    PICK --&gt; RES[\"生成发货单&lt;br/&gt;触发 WMS 出库\"]</pre><h2 id=\"单仓优先与拆单代价\">单仓优先与拆单代价</h2><p>路由的第一个决策是：能否用单仓完成整个订单？</p>\n<p>单仓发货对用户与平台都是最优的——一次配送、一个包裹、一份运费、一次客服接触点。所以标准做法是<strong>先尝试单仓解，失败才拆单</strong>。单仓解的存在性是一个集合覆盖（set cover）问题：找一个仓，它的可发 SKU 集合包含订单的全部 SKU 集合（集合覆盖的判定版本是 NP-完全的、优化版本是 NP-难的，贪心可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(n) \\le \\ln n + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的近似比，来源：Wikipedia — Set cover problem, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Set_cover_problem）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Set_cover_problem）。</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function findSingleWarehouse(order: OrderCandidate, warehouses: Warehouse[]): Promise&lt;Warehouse | null&gt; {&#10;  const needed = new Set(order.items.map((i) =&gt; i.skuId));&#10;  const candidates = warehouses&#10;    .filter((w) =&gt; isServiceable(w, order.address))&#10;    .filter((w) =&gt; hasCapacity(w, order))&#10;    .filter((w) =&gt; [...needed].every((sku) =&gt; w.available.has(sku)));&#10;&#10;  return candidates.sort((a, b) =&gt; routeScore(a, order) - routeScore(b, order))[0] ?? null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findSingleWarehouse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderCandidate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">warehouses</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Warehouse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Warehouse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> needed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order.items.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.skuId));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouses</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isServiceable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, order.address))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hasCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, order))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">needed].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w.available.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sku)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> routeScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, order) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> routeScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(b, order))[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>拆单时必须有<strong>拆单惩罚</strong>参与评分。不考虑惩罚的最优解会疯狂拆单——因为按 SKU 分别选最便宜的仓，总和可能确实更便宜，但用户体验、包材成本与客服成本被忽略了。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>方案</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>包裹数</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score(方案) = \\alpha \\cdot cost + \\beta \\cdot deliveryTime + \\gamma \\cdot (包裹数 - 1) + \\delta \\cdot stockHealth</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">方案</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">包裹数</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>惩罚系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 的正确取值需要通过历史数据校准：比较拆单订单与单仓订单的客诉率、退货率差异，把它折算成货币成本。很多团队直接设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 为一次运费，这是拍脑袋值，通常偏小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路由策略</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n<th>拆单率</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>就近单仓优先</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>高（SKU 分散时必然拆）</td>\n<td>时效敏感、SKU 覆盖面广的仓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本最低单仓</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>价格敏感品类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存健康优先</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>临期/滞销清货期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产能均衡</td>\n<td>略高</td>\n<td>略差</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大促高峰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>真实系统通常按商品类目与活动切换策略：日常用「就近单仓优先」，大促时对热门仓加产能惩罚从而自动转为「产能均衡」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨仓与区域限制\">跨仓与区域限制</h2><p>不是所有仓都能发所有地址。三类限制必须在候选检索阶段就排除，而不是在评分阶段扣分：</p>\n<p><strong>地理限制。</strong> 仓有服务范围（通常按行政区划或距离），境外/偏远地区可能只有少数仓可发。冷库、大件仓的覆盖范围更窄。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道限制。</strong> 某些仓只服务特定渠道（见 <a href=\"../inventory-model/sku-warehouse-model\">SKU 与分仓/渠道库存模型</a>），门店前置仓通常只服务自提与同城。</p>\n<p><strong>法规限制。</strong> 跨境订单涉及报关，只有具备保税资质的仓可发；某些品类（危化品、特殊药品）有仓储与运输资质要求。</p>\n<p>这三类限制应该在仓的元数据里显式建模，用一张 <code>warehouse_service_area</code> 表与 <code>warehouse_capability</code> 表表达，而不是散落在路由代码的 <code>if</code> 里。散落的后果是：新增一个仓需要改路由代码，而路由代码通常是最不敢改的那部分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE warehouse_capability (&#10;  warehouse_id  INT          NOT NULL,&#10;  capability    VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,   -- COLD_CHAIN / BONDED / BULKY / HAZMAT&#10;  enabled       TINYINT(1)   NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  priority      INT          NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (warehouse_id, capability)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE warehouse_service_area (&#10;  warehouse_id  INT          NOT NULL,&#10;  region_code   VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL,   -- 行政区划码，支持前缀匹配&#10;  delivery_days INT          NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (warehouse_id, region_code)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> warehouse_capability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  capability    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- COLD_CHAIN / BONDED / BULKY / HAZMAT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (warehouse_id, capability)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> warehouse_service_area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  region_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 行政区划码，支持前缀匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delivery_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (warehouse_id, region_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>region_code</code> 用行政区划码的前缀匹配（<code>3301%</code> 匹配杭州）可以用一条索引查询覆盖「某地址的所有可服务仓」，比存经纬度再做距离计算更容易维护，也更容易与运营的「服务范围表」对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预占粒度与履约的衔接\">预占粒度与履约的衔接</h2><p>履约路由与库存预占的衔接有三种模式，选择决定了「有单无货」是否会成为问题。</p>\n<p><strong>模式一：下单即定仓（reserve-with-warehouse）。</strong> 下单时路由已经算出仓，预占直接落在该仓。履约阶段零决策、零失败。这是最可靠的模式，代价是下单链路上多一次路由计算（通常 5–20 毫秒），且在仓产能变化时需要失效已有预占。</p>\n<p><strong>模式二：下单占虚拟池，支付后定仓（reserve-pool-then-route）。</strong> 下单快，但履约时可能出现「单仓凑不齐」。此时有三条出路：拆单（可能跨区运费高）、寻源（从其他仓或供应商处调货，时效不确定）、超卖容错（拒发并退款，最差）。这个模式必须配备降级流程，否则订单会卡在「待发货」状态无人处理。</p>\n<p><strong>模式三：混合。</strong> 对单 SKU 订单用模式一，对多 SKU 订单用模式二并预设拆单预案。这是许多平台的现实选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户下单&#10;    participant R as 路由服务&#10;    participant I as 库存服务&#10;    participant F as 履约服务&#10;    participant W as WMS&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;R: 提交订单 (SKU 列表 + 地址)&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;I: 查询各候选仓可用量&#10;    I--&gt;&gt;R: 仓 A/B/C 可用量&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 尝试单仓解 → 失败 → 拆单方案&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;I: 按方案预占 (SKU×仓)&#10;    I--&gt;&gt;R: 预占成功&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;F: 支付后触发出库指令&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;W: 下发发货单 (幂等键 = 订单号+仓+包裹号)&#10;    W--&gt;&gt;F: 受理成功&#10;    Note over F,W: WMS 受理失败 → 触发补偿与对账&lt;br/&gt;见 4_fulfillment-sync/2\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户下单\n    participant R as 路由服务\n    participant I as 库存服务\n    participant F as 履约服务\n    participant W as WMS\n    U-&gt;&gt;R: 提交订单 (SKU 列表 + 地址)\n    R-&gt;&gt;I: 查询各候选仓可用量\n    I--&gt;&gt;R: 仓 A/B/C 可用量\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 尝试单仓解 → 失败 → 拆单方案\n    R-&gt;&gt;I: 按方案预占 (SKU×仓)\n    I--&gt;&gt;R: 预占成功\n    R-&gt;&gt;F: 支付后触发出库指令\n    F-&gt;&gt;W: 下发发货单 (幂等键 = 订单号+仓+包裹号)\n    W--&gt;&gt;F: 受理成功\n    Note over F,W: WMS 受理失败 → 触发补偿与对账&lt;br/&gt;见 4_fulfillment-sync/2</pre><p>关键设计点：<strong>预占与路由必须是同一个决策的两半</strong>。如果路由服务算出的方案与预占实际落的仓不一致，就会出现「预占了仓 A，发货指令却下给了仓 B」，而仓 B 的库存根本没被扣。防御手段是把路由结果（仓 + 包裹划分）作为预占请求的参数，并让预占服务在内部校验每个 (SKU, 仓) 对是否与路由方案一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"履约路由的容错与人工介入\">履约路由的容错与人工介入</h2><p>路由不是一次性的计算，它是一个在履约窗口内可能被重算的过程。三个需要重算的场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>仓产能突降。</strong> 仓爆仓或设备故障，已预占的订单需要改仓。</li>\n<li><strong>库存差异。</strong> WMS 反馈预占的货实际不存在（盘点差异），需要重新寻源。</li>\n<li><strong>用户改址。</strong> 用户下单后修改收货地址，路由结果可能失效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重算的代价是已有预占需要「换仓」——这是一次释放加一次预占的组合，必须在单事务或幂等框架内完成，否则会出现两边都占住或两边都没占。推荐的实现是<strong>不切换仓，而是标记原预占为「待换仓」并由一个专门的重试任务处理</strong>：它先尝试新仓预占，成功后释放旧仓预占；失败则保留旧仓预占并重试或转人工。这个顺序保证任何时刻至少有一个仓的预占存在，不会出现「两头空」。</p>\n<p>所有自动流程都无法解决的场景必须进入人工队列，并有明确的 SLA。典型的是：某订单所有仓都凑不齐，且不在任何拆单方案的可行解里。人工的处置选项是调拨（从别的仓调货）、供应商直发（drop-ship）、或与用户协商取消并赔付。<strong>人工队列的存在不是设计失败，而是承认库存现实与账面必然存在差距</strong>——一个没有人工兜底的履约系统，会在第一次盘点差异时把订单永久卡住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>履约路由是多目标优化（成本、时效、库存健康、仓产能），不是「选最近的仓」。</li>\n<li>标准流程是先尝试单仓解（矩形覆盖问题），失败才拆单；拆单必须计入惩罚系数，且该系数应由历史客诉与退货数据校准而非拍脑袋。</li>\n<li>地理、渠道、法规三类服务限制必须建模为仓的元数据表，不在路由代码里硬编码 <code>if</code>。</li>\n<li>预占粒度与路由的衔接有三种模式：下单即定仓最可靠，虚拟池 + 后置路由最快但必须配降级流程；混合模式是现实选择。</li>\n<li>路由结果必须作为预占请求的参数并双向校验，否则会出现「预占了 A、发货下给 B」这类严重不一致。</li>\n<li>换仓用「先占新、后释旧」的顺序，保证任何时刻至少一个预占存在；自动流程解决不了的必须有人工队列与 SLA。</li>\n<li>下一步：发货指令下发之后，如何与仓储系统保持库存一致，见 <a href=\"wms-sync\">与仓储系统的库存同步/补偿</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多仓分货与履约路由","id":"多仓分货与履约路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单仓优先与拆单代价","id":"单仓优先与拆单代价"},{"level":2,"text":"跨仓与区域限制","id":"跨仓与区域限制"},{"level":2,"text":"预占粒度与履约的衔接","id":"预占粒度与履约的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"履约路由的容错与人工介入","id":"履约路由的容错与人工介入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预扣库存与活动备货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/pre-deduction-stockup"},"next":{"title":"与仓储系统的库存同步/补偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/fulfillment-sync/wms-sync"}}